WEBVTT

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.980
I knew it. The seal is at its limit.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.620
For the aura to leak this much.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.390
It's a matter of time until Dai Yoko revives.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:30.490
Listen, Tomohane, this is very important.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:34.660
Using your power,
I want you to search.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:35.970
Can you handle it?

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.800
Leave it to me.

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:41.740
We have to hurry.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:47.610
We must combine the Kawahira family's power and seal Dai Yoko once again.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.910
Hake, I will need your power and the others.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.780
As you wish, Master Kayano.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.330
Please wait, Master Kaoru.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:08.100
I will definitely find Master Keita.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.570
Let's go, Marro.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:24.550
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.820
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:34.760
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:51.240
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:58.310
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:04.950
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:12.630
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:17.370
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:21.200
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:24.510
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:30.210
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:34.550
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.820
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:43.930
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:47.160
Hang On, Tomohane!

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.230
"Hang On, Tomohane!"
Hang On, Tomohane!

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:50.000
Hang On, Tomohane!

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.670
A dream about the thing from the villa?

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:56.670
That's right. It was yesterday.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:02.110
Master Kaoru was standing next to that thing from the villa.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:09.190
After that, everyone got consumed by darkness.

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:12.150
In any case, it was a scary dream.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.160
A prediction?

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:17.690
If it's a dream Furano saw, then we can't just ignore it.

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:21.630
In the near future, that dream will become a reality...

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.530
Gokyoya, what should we do?

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.200
Should we directly ask Master Kaoru?

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:33.780
No, since that room was hidden so it wouldn't be found,

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.080
it means it should be a secret.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.380
So he wouldn't tell us.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.220
Then, what?

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.120
Let's talk with Master Keita.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.320
Master Keita?

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.290
Yeah.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:48.490
If it's about Master Kaoru, then he's probably the best to ask.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:55.530
Right, Master Keita should be able to do something.

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:07.340
Oh? Were you all out together?

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:09.610
Yeah, to Master Keita's place.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:14.250
But, Master Keita and Yoko weren't there.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.590
And it's been a week since they've been gone.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:20.060
They went on a job and haven't returned.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.160
What?

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:25.490
What's with that?
We went all the way to play.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:30.230
I wanted them to be a model for my new book for the winter event.

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:34.170
We made new veggies and wanted them to eat it.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.740
Boring!

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.940
Oh? So Master Keita is away today too?

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:42.340
You too?

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.380
Yes.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.950
Master Keita said that he's "as big as a horse".

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:49.720
So he wants to have a match with me.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:53.090
I was planning to take my favorite horse, Andalusia.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:54.460
Too bad.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.530
Horse
By "as big as a horse," you mean...

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.430
Do you even know what that means, Sendan?

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:04.900
Keita sure is popular.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.370
Master Kaoru?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.270
That's not it.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.670
It's not like he's popular or anything.

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:13.780
Right, he's more like everyone's toy.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.310
I see. My bad.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:22.220
By the way, I have something important to say to all of you.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.490
Come to the meeting room.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:25.990
Meeting in progress

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.760
What? Dai Yoko is?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.160
Grandmother just contacted me.

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:34.000
The seal is weakening.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:36.800
Dai Yoko is trying to revive.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.400
We must prevent that by all means.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:42.240
His claw splits the land.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.170
His voice blows away mountains.

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:48.010
Even the first generation,
Ekai Kawahira,

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.880
couldn't completely defeat him.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:53.580
The legendary monster, Dai Yoko.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:57.050
Every Inukami has heard of him.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:03.560
To make sure Dai Yoko doesn't revive,
I need everyone's power.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:04.690
Will you cooperate?

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.660
What are you saying?

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:10.030
We are the Inukami that swore allegiance to you.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:13.270
Our bodies and souls belong to you.

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.800
Isn't that right?

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:15.540
Yes.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:17.810
Thank you, everyone.

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:21.380
Seems like it's a big problem.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.380
It's an emergency so it can't be helped.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.910
Let's forget about that case for a bit.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.020
Umm.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:30.590
What's wrong, Igusa?

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:33.190
Tomohane isn't here.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.030
I appointed a different job for Tomohane.

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:38.890
Different job?

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:47.140
There's no scent of
Master Keita around this area.

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:50.640
All right, now let's check over there.

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:55.440
I see. Looking for Master Keita?

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.910
Aren't you glad, Tayune?

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.080
Why me?

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.790
I don't care if one or even three of that pervert...

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.690
Hey, your face is all red.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.090
You're so cute.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.290
It's not red.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.590
But is it okay with Tomohane alone?

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:14.400
I think so. Keita will surely come.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.600
He has always been that kind of person.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:22.700
Whenever someone was in pain or sadness,

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:27.440
the first generation, Ekai Kawahira, was always there for them.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:30.010
And Keita is like that?

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.450
You're overestimating him.

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:35.450
No, you were like that too.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.620
Well then everyone, hurry up and prepare.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:43.190
Gather at the entrance in 15 minutes.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.460
Yes.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.870
You look really happy, Master Kaoru.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.940
I mean, isn't it great?

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:58.910
Keita was hated by them at first.
Now they're waiting for him.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.110
Umm...

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:07.850
I heard that you asked Master Keita to decide our ranks a few days ago.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.890
Could it be you're...

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.850
If anything happens to me.

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:15.220
The only one I can rely on to take care of everyone is Keita.

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:19.460
I can trust him to take care of you guys.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:24.170
Besides, the one who should be hated is me.

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.370
No, you are...

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:27.900
It's fine, Nadeshiko.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:29.770
I know.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.240
I'm in no position to ask for forgiveness.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.150
But, everyone is important to me.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:40.350
That's why I want to entrust everything to Keita.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.850
Master Kaoru.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:47.860
Tomohane, I'm really counting on you to find Keita.

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:53.560
That frog backpack is so cute.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:59.770
That's right, I have to look for Master Keita first.

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:03.110
All right, let's do our best.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.440
There's something here.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.780
Why? Why can't I write at all?

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:21.790
Even though I have met mon amour
Yoko and gave birth to a new heroine.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:26.560
Am I unable to write a character who can rival her charm?

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:30.170
How frightening, my honey Yoko.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:37.510
Purification Flash.
Manifestation x1. Crimson.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:45.580
Dai Yoko's aura is leaking.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:48.780
Seems like weak evil spirits are getting restless.

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.420
I have to be careful.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.830
Twin tail. Little kid.

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:59.660
And that fluffy tail.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.160
Umm...

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.330
Knee socks. Culotte skirt.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.870
Round eyes. Glossy cheeks.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.440
Plump lips. Flat chest.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:12.940
How sweet!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:17.180
I'm overtaken by your sweetness!

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:20.180
How sweet

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:22.480
So sweet!

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:24.920
Be a model for my new book.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:35.060
He was so scary.

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:37.230
Is that also an evil spirit?

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.000
I have no time for this.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:44.010
Purification Flash. Manifestation x1.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.510
Tomohane Special.
Tell me where Master Keita is.

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:51.650
Still no good.

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:54.320
Where did Master Keita go?

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.850
I need to stay strong.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.590
All right, let's check the next place.

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:07.330
Master Keita. Yoko. Are you here?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:14.840
Master Keita?

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:19.240
No, he didn't come here.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.780
Is that so?

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.840
Keita Kawahira?

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:25.310
We haven't caught him lately.

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:27.180
Did he do something again?

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:29.580
No, I didn't mean that.

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:33.290
Tiny beast.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.920
Please wear this.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.230
Wear it!

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.030
N o!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.630
"Inukami!"

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.630
Woof woof.

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:49.300
"Inukami!"

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.610
Woof woof.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:56.210
Master Kaoru, we'll be going.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:59.450
I'm counting on you, Sendan.
We'll follow soon.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.720
Understood.

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:03.290
Well then everyone, onward.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.520
Yes.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:10.030
Nadeshiko gets to be alone with Master Kaoru again.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.560
Explosively suspicious.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:16.500
You twins. That's what you call a low-life suspicion.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:17.900
Have self control.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.170
Okay.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:24.310
I wonder if Tomohane found Keita.

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:26.810
It'll be troublesome if she didn't.

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:31.550
But, if they got into trouble at their job...

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:32.950
Could it be?

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.920
No way.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:38.550
Don't say such a thing.

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:43.730
But in that dream
I also saw Master Keita's future.

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:44.730
You did?

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:50.330
Yes. I saw him wearing a diaper and getting washed away in a sewer.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.540
What the heck is that?

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.670
Could it be a weird fetish?

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:58.810
Possibly.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:01.410
No, that's impossible.

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:04.580
I don't know what's happening.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:08.950
But there's no mistake that they will be involved in something bad.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:12.990
Not just Master Kaoru, but Master Keita too?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.610
For now, I'm leaving this matter to Sekidousai.

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:35.480
He's the only one I can rely on.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.620
Nadeshiko.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.990
Am I doing something wrong?

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:48.190
I deceived everyone and worked with Sekidousai.

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:50.560
Master Kaoru.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:55.600
I wonder what everyone would think if they knew this.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.130
I'm sure they wouldn't like it.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:02.840
I myself don't know if this is right or wrong.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:05.840
But if it's something you've decided,

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:08.510
then I will protect you with all my power.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.510
Thank you, Nadeshiko.

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:20.020
Master Keita. Yoko.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:21.760
Are you here?

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.730
They're not here either.

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.730
No, you pervert.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:28.530
Huh? Could it be?

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.900
Master Keita... Huh?

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:34.600
Stop resisting.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.740
I didn't do anything.

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:38.240
Shut up, pervert.

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:41.310
Geez, talking back while looking like that.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.380
What are you? Keita Kawahira?

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:46.110
Master Keita is not like that!

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.450
Don't lump him with this pervert.

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:00.900
I can't find him at all.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.800
Geez, where did he go?

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:06.900
I'm hungry.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:11.040
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.340
Yes.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.150
Wait, Sebastian.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.220
You're scaring her.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:25.650
You really aren't fit for customer service.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.620
Yes, I'm really sorry.

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.930
Oh, you guys.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:34.660
Oh? You're from that time.

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:41.470
Espoir

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.470
Thank you very much.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.380
Is it good?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.510
Yes. So you run a cake shop?

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.750
No.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:54.550
Right after Mr. Kawahira defeated the Reaper,

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:56.820
the Sindo family went bankrupt.

00:15:56.820 --> 00:16:01.360
After we tried everything, we finally opened this shop a couple days ago.

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.120
It's selling pretty good.

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:06.160
Oh, invite Keita and the others next time.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.330
What's wrong?

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:11.030
Master Keita hasn't come back for a while.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:15.070
There's trouble, so everyone's waiting for him.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:20.410
I don't think you need to worry about Keita.

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:25.280
If everyone's waiting, then he will surely come.

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:27.280
He'll definitely do something about it.

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:32.050
This is coming from someone he saved, so there's no mistaking it.

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:33.560
Indeed.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:37.660
He has something in him that makes you think he can do it.

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:41.230
Right, like a hero.

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.100
A hero?

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.780
Master Keita.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:17.200
Geez, Keita. When are you going to stop chasing after Maiko?

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.370
Umm, well, that's...

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:20.670
Until she looks at me?

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:22.100
I knew it!

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.240
Keita, you're the same as vegetables.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.210
You both attract bad bugs.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:30.410
Oh you're right.
Hey, don't lump me with bugs.

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:32.110
But you're alike.

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:39.990
Master Keita always came.

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:41.390
But...

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:55.600
What was that?

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.540
Those are...

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:05.750
Evil spirits.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.990
Give me your life.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:21.300
Purification Flash.
Manifestation x1. Crimson.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.730
I did it!

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:35.240
Crimson doesn't work.

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:37.380
My power is too weak.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.700
It's scary, but...

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:01.140
If I run away now,
I can't face Master Keita.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.480
Master Keita!

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.560
Master Kei...

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:27.830
Are you all right, Tomohane?

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:30.830
Pervert.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.500
This is why I didn't want to wear this!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.170
I'm not wearing this because I want to.

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.610
Don't misunderstand.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.910
You can't take it off, so it can't be helped.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.810
We'll talk later.

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:45.280
- Yoko, blow that thing away.
- Right.

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:50.890
Evil Blaze!

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:06.270
You really came, Master Keita.

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.210
So, what's with that outfit?

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:16.180
Well actually, a week ago,
Tomekichi called.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:19.950
The god of those monster cats wasn't feeling well.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:22.220
So they asked me to do something.

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:26.220
I somehow managed to resolve that.

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:30.930
They said I could have anything as a reward.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:36.560
As usual, he wished for paradise and tons of girlfriends.

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:40.070
But because he didn't use cat language when wishing,

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:43.610
their god mistook it and he ended up looking like this.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:45.510
You reap what you sow.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:46.740
Shut up.

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:49.910
Well, that's what happened.

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:52.710
But why does this kind of thing keep happening to me!?

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:57.950
Well well. This is perfect, this is the best. Bravo Kawahira.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:01.090
This way you can appear in a boys love series.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:02.560
The fan girls will love you.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:03.260
No thanks.

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:04.790
But...

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:06.530
Don't laugh.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.360
See, little girl?

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:09.930
I said he'll help you.

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.100
Yes.

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:15.600
Master Keita.

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:16.800
Hey, what's wrong?

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:20.840
I've been looking for you for a while.

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:25.050
Master Keita.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:43.130
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:48.500
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:53.680
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:58.880
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:02.050
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.620
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.760
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.630
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:16.400
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.010
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:26.770
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:35.650
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:41.960
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.100
Inukami!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.040
See you!

00:22:55.500 --> 00:22:58.040
Due to marriage or adoption,

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:00.980
there can be non blood-related family.

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.550
"A non blood-related macho brother keeps waking me up every morning!"

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:09.120
Or, "Oh no, a non blood-related macho father

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:11.790
keeps mistakenly entering my bed at night."

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:16.420
The word "in law" reeks of taboo and at times, smells sweet.

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:17.890
Next on Inukami.

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:19.690
"Father and Groom!"

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:20.060
In-laws.

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:21.160
Father and Groom!

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:24.270
Will they ever understand each other?

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:25.070
Father and Groom!
